menu "RTK Bluetooth SPP (ADR-0006)"

    config RTK_BT_SPP_RX_BUF_SIZE
        int "Per-session RX stream buffer size (bytes)"
        range 1024 16384
        default 4096
        help
            Each SPP session owns one static receive StreamBuffer of this size. Bytes arriving while it is
            full are dropped and counted as rx_dropped. NTRIP corrections relayed by the phone arrive in
            bursts of several KB, so the default is 4096. Total static RAM = this value x RTK_BT_SPP_MAX_SESSIONS.

endmenu
